    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019re not a hero. You\u2019re just a lucky bastard. But luck is a fickle thing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ruthless adult visual novel where success demands sacrifice \u2014 love, loyalty, or worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adult visual novel soaked in dirty morality and sexual freedom. The protagonist is a man in his 40s \u2014 once a decent businessman, now consumed by greed and the hunger for power. At the start, he\u2019s a big child with a \u201ctake what you can\u201d philosophy. Women are just a source of pleasure. He\u2019s married, but never faithful. He manipulates, dominates, and sacrifices others for a deal that could bring obscene wealth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But everything changes when he loses his anchor \u2014 his assistant Julia. The woman who was his mirror and moral compass is gone. Now, he must crawl through a web of sex, lies, betrayal, and power \u2014 with no guide, and no safety net.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player decides who he becomes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A man destroyed by his own sins, seeking redemption</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A seducer of a powerful investor\u2019s wife</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fool who realizes the cost of loyalty too late</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A broken soul saved by someone he once despised</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or a man who dies without ever changing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching storyline with multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explicit 18+ scenes without censorship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep characters who shape the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 4 hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6,000+ renders and 350 animations</p></li></ul>",
